{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14226912","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226912","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422691201:1":{"text":"これは……カタストロフの気配！","source_cn":"这是……恶魔的气息！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A432141740139AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1422691201":{"text":"これは……カタストロフの気配！","source_cn":"这是……恶魔的气息！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A432141740139AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422691202:1":{"text":"なんだと？ドゥアガルに寄生していた魔物は、このカタストロフと同じ存在だったということか？","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD9714CEE5EC74DE2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"なんだと？ドゥアガルに寄生していた魔物は、このカタストロフと同じ存在だったということか？","female":"なんだと？ドゥアガルに寄生していた魔物は、このカタストロフと同じ存在だったということか？","variant_male_record_index":"167218","variant_female_record_index":"167219","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422691203:1":{"text":"これですべてハッキリしたのう。明月樹に封印されていた秘密の空間、サロクディアの魔物と同じ気配を漂わせているカタストロフ……","source_cn":"一切都解释得通了。被封印在皎月树下的秘密空间，又与萨洛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2874289A6DC7E7A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422691204:1":{"text":"おそらく、こやつが、かつてフォレストエッグに寄生したカタストロフじゃろう。","source_cn":"这恶魔应该也是当年污染了翡绿之卵的恶魔，或者说，是它的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D09F2702E34D